//- The one "Export" popup every chart-style board view opens - the ten
  report charts, Time, and the three Gantt views. Same look as the board /
  swimlane / list / card export popup (exportScope.jade): a pop-over list of
  formats, each a direct download link. A chart has no field selection, so
  there is no left pane. The view says which chart it is through the
  `chartKey` data context; the URL is built in one place (exportChart.js).
template(name="exportChartPopup")
  ul.pop-over-list
    each formats
      li
        //- The server supplies the localized filename.
        a(href="{{url}}" download)
          i.fa(class="{{icon}}")
          | {{label}}
